Icon tables
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

internal/ui/icons/extensions.go maps file names and extensions to Nerd Font
glyphs. The table is Devpit's own, but its idea and structure are inspired by
lazygit's pkg/gui/presentation/file_icons.go.

    lazygit
    https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit
    Copyright (c) 2018 Jesse Duffield
    MIT License

The glyph codepoints themselves come from the Nerd Fonts project's nf-fa,
nf-dev, nf-seti and nf-oct ranges.

    Nerd Fonts
    https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts
    Copyright (c) 2014 Ryan L McIntyre
    MIT License

Devpit does not bundle any font file. The optional icon font installer
downloads Symbols Nerd Font Mono from an official Nerd Fonts release and
verifies its checksum before installing it for the current user only.

